ont></div><div><font color="#0f172a">3.&nbsp; **Physical Examination Contradictions:** In the physiatrist consult note on 05/07, the template states *"BADLs: independent"*, which directly contradicts the clinical picture of *mRS 5, bedrest, NG tube, and Foley insertion*. This appears to be a copy-paste error from the premorbid section and needs correction to *"BADLs: totally dependent"*.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font color="#0f172a">4.&nbsp; **Management Durations:** The exact timeline or plan for the Dual Antiplatelet Therapy (DAPT) duration (e.g., 21 days vs. 90 days before transitioning to single antiplatelet therapy) is not documented.</font></div><div></div>